    "text": "1. Select Courses\n\n2. Analyzing\n\n3. Review Changes\n\n4. Download & Sync\n\n5. Complete\n\nReview Changes\nHelp\nSelect the files you want to sync, and ignore the ones you don't need.\n11\nNew files\n6\nUpdates available\n2\nEdited locally\n4\nDeleted locally\n2\nDeleted on Canvas\nSmart Select\nBy filetype\n\nDOCX (5/9)\n\nHTML (all)\n\nPDF (6/8)\n\nPPTX (all)\n\nSelect All\n\nDeselect All\n\n1.\nIndføring i organisationers opbygning og funktion (LA)\nIndføring i organisationers opbygning og funktion (LA E25 BINTO1060U)\n21 files pending sync\n239 files up to date\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nNew Files\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nUpdates Available\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nUpdates Available — You've Edited These\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nDeleted Locally\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nDeleted on Canvas (Kept Locally)\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nIgnored Files\n\n⚠️ 4 new files look like files you may already have\nThey are the same size and type as files already in your course folder, but the names are too different to be certain it is the same file, so it was not matched. For example, “Klyngevejledning_1_Program_2022.pdf” looks like “zz omdøbt uden række 1.pdf” in your folder. Hover the ⚠️ next to a file to see which of your files it resembles. You can leave it checked to download a fresh copy - your own files are never renamed, overwritten or deleted - uncheck it if you know you already have it, or use the eye icon to skip it for good.\n\nGo back\n\nSync & Download 15 files",
